0001 creates catalog schema and PostgreSQL publication/immutability guards.
0002 seeds the unverified reference catalog as DRAFT, without religious text.
DATABASE_URL is required. See the root README and codex/PR-01_CATALOG_SCORING.md.
Never reset or migrate a database automatically on app startup.
0003 adds users, auth sessions, external identities, settings and library author FK.
Its downgrade deletes accounts and sessions; use disposable test databases only.
See codex/PR-02_ACCOUNTS_AUTH.md for authentication contracts and limitations.
0004 adds daily journal snapshots and mutation receipts. Downgrade deletes history.
See codex/PR-03_CORE_JOURNAL.md for the date/release and offline contracts.

0005 adds fasting overrides, regional Ramadan calendars and journal baselines.
Existing journals retain PR-03 weekly eligibility. Downgrade deletes plans,
calendar configuration and baselines; use disposable test databases only.
See codex/PR-04_FASTING.md.
